    "title": "Enforce routing eligibility before scoring",
    "description": "Make the routing boundary explicit in code: hard pins and capability/context/power constraints determine eligibility before any cost, utilization, performance, or sticky scoring is applied. This complements the existing harness-pin work rather than replacing it.",
